# Outcaster Greenblade: "+1/+1 for each Desert you control". Bot1 plays a Desert (2/3); Bot2 then plays a Desert and a Forest on its turn:
# neither the opponent's Desert nor a nonDesert land counts, so it stays 2/3 and a Desert it controls gets counted only for Bot1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Outcaster Greenblade
Island x3
Desert
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Desert
Forest
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Outcaster Greenblade.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Search(Desert)
Bot1.Hand.Desert.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Outcaster Greenblade.Power = 2
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Desert.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Outcaster Greenblade.Power = 2
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Outcaster Greenblade.Power = 2

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Outcaster Greenblade.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Outcaster Greenblade.Toughness = 3
